{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "bfda6c5d550cb55ff18e26b378e7f2705d5385667d2ab866d72cbcd4aebab485", "ja": "インタビューのお仕事", "zh": "采访工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5000_place", "source_sha256": "25e6eba6c7b6a495223c94618f3b0fffa1fc5b2b2f4abb4d6e4fa90044d3ae4c", "ja": "合唱コンクール会場", "zh": "合唱比赛会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5001_p", "source_sha256": "a05663e816c183884f63bab8a1519bf2f0678c906cfc1dc405abffa30a257685", "ja": "（今日は、合唱コンクールの全国大会に来ている。\n紗代子の仕事は、入賞した学校へのインタビューだ）", "zh": "（今天来参加合唱比赛的全国大赛。纱代子的工作是采访获奖学校。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5002_027say", "source_sha256": "cfce9adc5ed0d365a8638ad24ccf1693f37da8103190cdedcff6883a2b047026", "ja": "全国レベルの合唱は、一体感がすごいんですね。\n歌声にも力があって……私、感動しました！", "zh": "全国级别的合唱，凝聚力真强啊。\n歌声也充满力量……我被感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5003_p", "source_sha256": "070c197815cb7530c421b62022019e27144f2076ad4ff3cc52afeeae5bcc459b", "ja": "そうだな。これからインタビューする学校は、\n金賞の学校だけど、納得のうまさだったよ。", "zh": "是啊。接下来要采访的学校虽然是获得金奖的学校，但唱得确实让人心服口服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5004_027say", "source_sha256": "50b29401c553ac970607278188516f0b68cb255cda0e205ef67d5ea95b750c14", "ja": "はい！　胸に響く歌声が、とっても素敵でした。\nどうすれば、あんな風に歌えるんだろう？", "zh": "是的！那歌声直击心灵，真的太棒了。\n到底要怎样才能唱得那么好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5005_027say", "source_sha256": "743e91e43c0cacd3745461ebf63b189868a542ec63638124a2558ce107313876", "ja": "色々聞いてみたいことがありますけど、\nインタビューの時間、短いんですよね……。", "zh": "我有好多想问的，不过采访时间很短，对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5006_p", "source_sha256": "7df79282587af558162cccbb3815dd8ef3f463a971c29952934e21aa5135095e", "ja": "ああ。質問は絞った方がいいだろうな。\nもしインタビューで聞くなら……。", "zh": "啊。问题还是精选一些比较好。\n如果要在采访中提问的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5007", "source_sha256": "6d203f2e693130b4029d8ee568896bf5493e2d2fd8a8f5153d5c230c6047f3fd", "ja": "歌に込めた気持ち", "zh": "蕴含在歌中的心意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5008", "source_sha256": "2d088590a568ff5a7d3b9d0f56531f9e75bd598d37355786ca69a0997aa29b1e", "ja": "練習方法", "zh": "练习方法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5200_p", "source_sha256": "a3c48eaa1174159d12e3f688eb9c1e8cd5260f530e5f807ef253911b31de61c0", "ja": "どんな気持ちを込めたか、聞いてみるのはどうだ？\n紗代子が感動した理由がわかるかもしれない。", "zh": "问问她融入了怎样的感情如何？\n或许能明白纱代子感动的原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5201_027say", "source_sha256": "28e09fd658e4045cf2d19f7dcf1ccb6703cd82fd369ec688b38dede33dc4ce58", "ja": "そうですね。聞いた人の心が動いたのは、\n声に乗せた想いが、ちゃんと届いたからですよね。", "zh": "是啊。能让听歌的人为之动容，是因为通过歌声传达的心意，确实传达到了对方心里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5202_027say", "source_sha256": "221f6b8544259070e1b487ac74fdf5a526f34ce2db866d72f912f9ab6c51eade", "ja": "感動する歌声の秘密を、私も聞いてみたいです。\nどんなエピソードが聞けるか楽しみです。ふふっ♪", "zh": "我也想听听，能打动人心的歌声究竟有什么秘诀。\n真期待能听到怎样的故事。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5300_p", "source_sha256": "a3c48eaa1174159d12e3f688eb9c1e8cd5260f530e5f807ef253911b31de61c0", "ja": "どんな気持ちを込めたか、聞いてみるのはどうだ？\n紗代子が感動した理由がわかるかもしれない。", "zh": "问问她融入了怎样的感情如何？\n或许能明白纱代子感动的原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5301_027say", "source_sha256": "2a32e899274ba325ada17df87e14a558a3285d329f3e7d3efb39ddaa7128d3bc", "ja": "声に気持ちを乗せるのって、難しいんですよね。\n全国大会となれば、緊張もするでしょうし……。", "zh": "要在歌声中融入感情，真的很不容易呢。\n而且又是全国大赛，想必也会紧张吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5302_027say", "source_sha256": "1186d7bbcae5ba64d5893a70c27a49489a157f9e262a3f320555621e1e44384a", "ja": "任せてください。バッチリ全部聞きだしてみせます！\nあっ。これ時間内におさまるかな……？", "zh": "交给我吧。我一定会把全部内容都问出来的！\n\n啊，这能在规定时间内结束吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5500_p", "source_sha256": "74fb094c7922185db36acd2aa3b9d7951aed0340ef8046b59a72601f6d71286c", "ja": "練習方法は、ちょっと気になるかな。\n歌声の秘訣は、誰もが知りたいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "练习方法，我有点好奇呢。\n歌声的秘诀，大家应该也都很想知道吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5501_027say", "source_sha256": "a417942cf2bfcd2ce76de129a7fbe0a4d253f26254d12e9b5b2d7ef5b9da3286", "ja": "確かに。大勢で合わせる難しさは、私もわかります。\nだからこそ、たくさん努力したんだってことも。", "zh": "确实如此。要和大家合在一起有多难，我也深有体会。\n也正因如此，才付出了那么多努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5502_027say", "source_sha256": "9c278deb032be740f09cdfe4c448e130b646a6db0545b67ebe3f5295d888816a", "ja": "努力の秘訣、さっそく聞いてきますね！\n参考にできそうなら、私も取り入れてみようかな。", "zh": "我这就去请教一下努力的秘诀！\n如果有值得参考的地方，我也试着运用一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5600_p", "source_sha256": "74fb094c7922185db36acd2aa3b9d7951aed0340ef8046b59a72601f6d71286c", "ja": "練習方法は、ちょっと気になるかな。\n歌声の秘訣は、誰もが知りたいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "练习方法，我有点好奇呢。\n歌声的秘诀，大家应该也都很想知道吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5601_027say", "source_sha256": "84ad77e68da95005f7ba810abdb9497b2f73929ad84d21d477f22c045aabab26", "ja": "はい、私も知りたいです！　どんな練習をして、\n今回、金賞に結びついたのか聞いてみたいです！", "zh": "是的，我也想知道！真想问问，是做了怎样的练习，才在这次获得金奖的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_5602_027say", "source_sha256": "82ec39deb76c5265dc54fc4a148617a4ae9be0c750789c8540ba44502a4a576b", "ja": "あ、でも他の人には教えたくないって言われたら……。\n{$P$}、その時はどうしましょう？", "zh": "啊，不过要是对方说不想告诉其他人的话……\n{$P$}，那时候该怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
